    {"type":"text","text":"  PROCEDURE                 │  procedures/subject.yaml                 no baseline — no Store\n  ──────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n                            │ # Every mark the gutter carries on a Procedure, on one screen.\n                            │ kind: procedure\n                            │ procedure: subject\n  envelope ✓                │ targets: [local, staging]\n                            │ steps:\n  read             staging  │   - id: enumerate  # a read, and the Target it binds\n                            │     definition: things-observed\n                            │     operation: list_things\n                            │     target: staging\n                            │     args:\n                            │       page_size: \"100\"\n                            │\n  mutate!          staging  │   - id: make\n                            │     definition: things\n                            │     operation: make_thing\n                            │     target: staging\n                            │     args:\n                            │       name: preview-42\n                            │\n  mutate           staging  │   - id: make-bounded\n                            │     definition: things\n                            │     operation: make_thing\n                            │     target: staging\n                            │     over:\n                            │       values:\n                            │         - preview-43\n                            │         - preview-44\n                            │     args:\n                            │       name: {item: $}\n                            │     bound: 4\n                            │\n  DESTROY          staging  │   - id: retire\n                            │     definition: things\n                            │     operation: end_thing\n                            │     target: staging\n                            │     over:\n                            │       assets:\n                            │         - field: name\n                            │           starts_with: preview-\n                            │     args:\n                            │       thing_id: {item: $.id}\n                            │     bound: 5\n                            │\n  DESTROY  opaque  local    │   - id: scrub\n                            │     definition: commands-destroy\n                            │     operation: destroy\n                            │     target: local\n                            │     over:\n                            │       assets:\n                            │         - field: stdout\n                            │           starts_with: preview-\n                            │     args:\n                            │       command: [rm, -rf, /srv/preview]\n                            │\n  unresolved                │   - id: no-such-definition\n                            │     definition: not-there\n                            │     operation: list_things\n                            │     target: staging\n                            │\n  unresolved                │   - id: no-such-operation\n                            │     definition: things\n                            │     operation: not_there\n                            │     target: staging\n                            │\n  unresolved                │   - id: no-such-provider\n                            │     definition: orphan\n                            │     operation: list_things\n                            │     target: staging\n                            │\n                   staging  │   - id: nested\n                            │     procedure: inner\n                            │\n  unresolved                │   - id: no-such-procedure\n                            │     procedure: not-there\n\n  AUTHORITY   assembled from definitions/ and targets/\n  DEFINITION        TARGET   DEFINITION KINDS  TARGET KINDS         EFFECTIVE   DESTROY OPS\n  commands-destroy  local    destroy           read destroy         d           destroy\n  not-there         staging  unresolved        read mutate destroy  unresolved  unresolved\n  orphan            staging  read              read mutate destroy  r           —\n  things            staging  mutate destroy    read mutate destroy  m d         end_thing\n  things-observed   staging  read              read mutate destroy  r           —\n\n  FLAGS   index into the gutter above — no flag states anything the gutter does not\n  UNBOUNDED   line 13  step make                mutate with no declared bound\n  DESTROY     line 32  step retire              end_thing, bound 5\n  DESTROY     line 44  step scrub               destroy\n  OPAQUE      line 44  step scrub               destroy reaches an effect hyper cannot describe\n  UNBOUNDED   line 44  step scrub               an opaque destroy takes no bound\n  UNRESOLVED  line 55  step no-such-definition  definition: not-there — no definitions/not-there.yaml\n  UNRESOLVED  line 60  step no-such-operation   operation: not_there — no such Operation in providers/things.yaml\n  UNRESOLVED  line 65  step no-such-provider    provider: not-installed — no built-in Provider and no providers/not-installed.yaml\n  UNRESOLVED  line 73  step no-such-procedure   procedure: not-there — no procedures/not-there.yaml\n  ENVELOPE    line 4   ok                       no step reaches a target outside [local, staging]\n"}
